        },
        "faq_item_EnxBqF": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does Threaditate work?",
            "answer": "<p>You upload a photo to the app, and it converts it into a personalized string-by-number guide in seconds. Your kit arrives with everything you need: a loom, thread, tools, and a phone stand to hold your guide. From there, you follow the steps, confirm each string placement, and build toward a finished piece one string at a time.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_XcnwX8": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is Threaditate hard to do?",
            "answer": "<p>Not really. Threaditate is designed so that no crafting background is required. The app accounts for that from the first step. It might look complicated in photos, but the guided confirmation process breaks the whole project into a series of small, manageable moves. If you can place a string and tap confirm, you can finish a Threaditate.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_ExUz6V": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What skill level do I need?",
            "answer": "<p>Zero experience required. The app converts your photo into a numbered guide and walks you through every placement in real time. There's no prior knowledge assumed at any step. If you can follow a confirmed sequence, you can finish a Threaditate.</p>"
          }
        },
        "topic_header_RLpthH": {
          "type": "topic_header",
          "settings": {
            "topic_title": "The Kit"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_eeaBHi": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What exactly do I get with my order?",
            "answer": "<p>The full kit includes: 20\" interlocking loom (pins pre-placed, tool-free assembly), pre-cut thread set with spool holder, precision stringing tool, numbered paper template, wooden phone stand, zip ties, convertible easel box, and free access to the Threaditate companion app. Open the box and you're ready to start your session the same day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_kA8bGJ": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need the app?",
            "answer": "<p>The app is what makes Threaditate guided rather than instructional. Without it, you have a loom and thread. With it, you have a real-time session that walks you through every string placement from your specific photo. It's free, available on iOS and Android, and included with every kit.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_DdcYmc": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need any extra tools or materials?",
            "answer": "<p>Nothing extra needed. The kit is complete: loom, thread, tools, phone stand, easel, and app. The box even converts to a stable work surface, so you don't need a separate stand. Your first session can start the same day the kit arrives.</p>"
          }
        },
        "topic_header_JeRzp6": {
          "type": "topic_header",
          "settings": {
            "topic_title": "The Process"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_jEKgbr": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does it take?",
            "answer": "<p>The estimated completion time is between 4-8 hours, design-dependent. Sessions can be paused and resumed at any point — progress is saved automatically in the app. No session time limits. No restart required if you step away.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_Ah76tC": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if I make a mistake?",
            "answer": "<p>Keep going. Threaditate's loom is forgiving by design, so small errors tend to blend into the finished piece in a way that surprises most first-time makers. And because the app confirms each step individually, losing your place only means returning to your last confirmed string, not starting over.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_VJJHrx": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I pause and come back to it?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The app saves your progress after every confirmed step, so you can put it down and pick it up whenever you're ready. Some people finish in one sitting. Others take it a session at a time over the course of a week. The guide holds your place either way.</p>"
          }
        },
